# pstack model configuration. One line per role. Delete a line to fall back to the skill default.
# `inherit-parent` or `auto` as a value: the role runs on the parent chat model (omit Task `model`). Alias entries in a panel list still count toward its fan-out.
# budget: small (medium)
# All roles use Grok. Trivial edits use composer-2.5. Code default is grok-4.7-medium. Escalation is grok-4.7-high. The single cheap diff reviewer (`interrogate reviewers`) is grok-4.7-low.
# One agent per task. One try per rung, then step up: composer-2.5, then grok-4.7-medium, then grok-4.7-high. The reviewer rung is grok-4.7-low, one try.
# Never use third-party models unless Marek explicitly approves that specific task.
# No arena, swarm, or multi-model panels. Panel role lines below are a single model so a stray invocation does not fan out.
# No fast mode. No extended context. Never use Fable models.
trivial: composer-2.5
feature, refactoring: grok-4.7-medium
bug-fix: grok-4.7-medium
perf-issue: grok-4.7-medium
hillclimb: grok-4.7-medium
judgment and prose: grok-4.7-medium
hardest tasks: grok-4.7-high
how explorer: grok-4.7-medium
how explainer: grok-4.7-medium
